1
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:34,200
It's only right that one gets married.
There's no need to be shy

2
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:38,800
I've heard far too many rumours,
do you know that?

3
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:43,800
Don't let the rumours
bother you, Mother

4
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:48,800
I know everyone's saying I'm too close
to Miss Ma. Just ignore them

5
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:54,800
You aren't just too close.
They even say...

6
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,800
-What is it?
-They say...

7
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:01,200
It sounds too awful!

8
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:05,200
I just don't know how to
imitate those gossipmongers

9
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:09,200
Don't do it then

10
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:15,800
But I have to get it off my chest
or I'll feel stifled!

11
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:21,200
Mother, if you keep nagging at me,
I can't concentrate on my reading

12
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,200
Let me have some peace

13
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:26,100
Hold it!

14
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:29,900
Listen good!

15
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:34,100
I must iron things out with you today

16
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:38,300
All right, say your piece.
I'm all ears

17
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:45,100
Everybody's saying you're incapable

18
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:50,900
I wonder if it's because Miss Ma
thinks you're not worthy of her,

19
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:56,900
or is it that you have
that sort of problem

20
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:05,300
Who's the one who says
I have that sort of problem?!

21
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:08,300
Cool it, son

22
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:13,300
That's why you must marry Miss Ma
quickly to stop all the gossip

23
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:19,900
Prove it to everyone
how worthy and capable you can be!

24
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:25,100
Marriage isn't a game, Mother.
You can't use it to spite others

25
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:31,300
Don't tell me you don't intend to
marry Miss Ma anymore?

26
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:34,300
I never said that

27
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:41,300
Why wait then? Be honest.
Does she look down on us?

28
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:46,300
Of course not, Mother.
She's a bright and kindhearted girl

29
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:49,300
She'd never look down on us

30
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:53,300
I'd say she's different from
all other women

31
00:03:54,900 --> 00:03:58,900
That's it then!
Don't drag on anymore, son

32
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:04,300
You used to be one of the
three vermins of Ping'an Town

33
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:10,900
At that time, you had no achievement.
I couldn't say anything then

34
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:15,900
But you're now a renowned physician.
I don't see why you can't get a wife

35
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:20,900
Go for it, son!

36
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:24,300
Go for it!

37
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:30,900
Speak to Miss Ma again.
I'll approach Matchmaker Su too

38
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:35,900
Find out about her family and
whether her parents are still around

39
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:42,900
Come to think of it, she's never
told me anything about her family

40
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:49,100
I see, she has no kith or kin.
Poor girl

41
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:54,300
Marry her soon. We'll give her
a family full of warmth!

42
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:59,300
You're the only male descendant, son

43
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:03,300
I'm counting on you
to carry on our family line

44
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:07,100
You must never let me down,
all right?

45
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:14,300
Don't worry, Mother.
I'll do my best to settle this matter

46
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:18,100
Go for it!

47
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:39,300
Who could it be at this hour?

48
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:44,100
Who is it?

49
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:58,300
Old sir, we're not buying any donkey.
It's late. Go home to sleep

50
00:05:58,300 --> 00:06:04,900
I'm here to visit an old friend.
How have you been, Longevity?

51
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:09,300
I don't get you at all

52
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:15,300
You look scary by riding a donkey
backwards in the middle of the night

53
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:17,300
Are you a human or a ghost?

54
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:24,900
Oh, you silly fool!
I'm neither. I'm an immortal

55
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:26,900
Immortal?

56
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:30,900
Where are you going?

57
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:36,300
Who are you?
Are you here to take my soul away...?

58
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:38,300
I haven't fulfilled my ambitions

59
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:42,300
Many people are waiting
for me to cure them

60
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:49,300
And my mother expects me
to get married and have offspring

61
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:51,900
I'm to carry on the family line

62
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:56,300
If I'm gone now,
my family will have no heir

63
00:06:56,300 --> 00:07:00,300
I mustn't be so unfilial.
Please let me off...

64
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:05,900
What a coward you are!
Get up...!

65
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:10,900
Look at me! Don't you recognize me?
I'm not a ghost who's after your soul

66
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:12,900
I'm Zhang Guolao

67
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:16,300
Who's Zhang Guolao?

68
00:07:16,300 --> 00:07:22,100
You don't know Zhang Guolao?
I'm your ex-colleague, Zhang Guolao!

69
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:32,300
I don't see anything. I'm sleepy.
I'm going back to bed. Goodbye

70
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:36,100
Stay where you are!

71
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:42,300
I'm here specially to see you.
Listen good. I'll only say this once

72
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,300
Shoot

73
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:47,300
You used to be the Longevity Star
of the Three Stars in Heaven

74
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:49,300
We often called you Longie

75
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:54,300
Once you broke the celestial rules
and were demoted to mortals

76
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:59,900
Wu Fuqi was the Fortune Star,
and Wei Delu, the Prosperity Star

77
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:05,300
You came down to the mortal world
all at the same time

78
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:09,300
You're destined to suffer here and have
no fortune, prosperity or longevity

79
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:14,300
But so long as you strive hard
and do good for mankind,

80
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:17,300
you'll be able to rejoin
the group of immortals!

81
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:22,300
Group of immortals?
I only know grouper...

82
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:25,300
Fancy you still thinking of
eating fish!

83
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:29,300
If you can't become immortals
before you turn 30,

84
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:31,300
more tribulations will come your way

85
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:37,300
Can I join the "grouper"
together with Ruyi then?

86
00:08:38,300 --> 00:08:43,300
You still can't forget her!
Women are nothing but trouble!

87
00:08:45,300 --> 00:08:50,900
You may scold or beat me but don't
you insult the woman I love most!

88
00:08:50,900 --> 00:08:53,300
She isn't trouble!
She is...

89
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,100
Ruyi!

90
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:03,300
Bear this in mind. The biggest
trouble in the mortal world is love

91
00:09:03,300 --> 00:09:09,300
When I was a mortal, I used to have...
I'd rather not talk about it

92
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:15,300
There are eight things you must forgo
to become an immortal:

93
00:09:15,300 --> 00:09:19,300
desire for money, lust, home, ties, fear
of hardship and death, anger, hatred,

94
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:22,300
and stubbornness!
Stubbornness!

95
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:27,300
What more pleasure is there
as an immortal?

96
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:30,300
Oh, the pleasure is immense!

97
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:34,300
You must bear my words in mind.
See you another day!

98
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:36,100
White-haired fellow!

99
00:09:37,300 --> 00:09:40,300
How do I know what you said is true?

100
00:09:40,300 --> 00:09:44,300
Go to the Three-Star Temple at
Longevity Village and you'll know

101
00:09:44,300 --> 00:09:46,100
Farewell

102
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:49,300
Did you say Longevity Village?

103
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:53,300
If you still don't believe me,
open up your palm and see

104
00:09:55,300 --> 00:09:58,300
-Will you beat me?
-No

105
00:09:58,300 --> 00:10:00,300
-You won't?
-No

106
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,300
All right

107
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:08,900
It's all in your hand!

108
00:10:10,300 --> 00:10:15,900
You may have become mortals, but all
of you have a line across your palms

109
00:10:15,900 --> 00:10:20,300
Just put together your palms
and you'll know what I mean

110
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:24,900
If you still don't get it, go to the
Three-star Temple in Longevity Village

111
00:10:25,300 --> 00:10:27,100
Farewell

112
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:28,300
White-haired fellow!

113
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,300
Longevity Village?

114
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:32,300
You still don't get it?

115
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:44,100
Thanks

116
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:49,300
Don't hit me!

117
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:56,700
So it was only a dream.
What a fright!

118
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:03,300
Why did I have such a dream?
Who was the old man in the dream?

119
00:11:04,300 --> 00:11:06,300
He said I'm an immortal

120
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:11,900
I'm an immortal?
How strange

121
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:16,300
Oh, my head hurts...

122
00:11:22,300 --> 00:11:28,900
Why did I dream of a silly old man
instead of Ruyi?

123
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:30,900
How ridiculous

124
00:11:33,300 --> 00:11:37,300
Oh, it really hurts.
What's wrong with me?

125
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:50,900
There's nobody else around

126
00:11:52,300 --> 00:11:55,900
Why is the person in the mirror old
and all his hair, grey?

127
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:08,900
Everything's fine. Stop scaring
myself. I'm Mei Shouquan

128
00:12:09,300 --> 00:12:11,300
Was I seeing things just now?

129
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:30,900
-Good news, Your Lordship!
-Bad news, Your Lordship!

130
00:12:30,900 --> 00:12:33,300
-It's good news!
-It's bad news!

131
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:35,300
Shut up!
What is it?

132
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:40,900
We discovered that in the process of
helping the Trio re-attain immortality,

133
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,900
Ma-gu has fallen for Longevity Star

134
00:12:42,900 --> 00:12:47,300
Last night, she even kissed
Mei Shouquan like this!

135
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:50,300
It was disgusting!

136
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:52,300
Really?

137
00:12:53,300 --> 00:12:57,100
That's to say,
Ma-gu has acquired mortal desires

138
00:12:57,300 --> 00:13:02,900
That's for sure! She wouldn't
have... with Mei Shouquan otherwise!

139
00:13:06,300 --> 00:13:08,300
This is good news!

140
00:13:09,300 --> 00:13:15,100
Ma-gu went to the mortal world
on the sly and even fell for a mortal

141
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:19,300
If the Jade Emperor
finds out about it...

142
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:24,100
I can just sit back and relax

143
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:28,300
The Jade Emperor will demote her
to a mortal for sure!

144
00:13:34,300 --> 00:13:36,300
How come I'm not moving at all?

145
00:13:37,300 --> 00:13:39,300
Are you skiing, Old Master Zhang?

146
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:41,300
How come you aren't moving at all?

147
00:13:44,100 --> 00:13:45,100
Stop!

148
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:52,300
-What are you doing?
-We're skiing!

149
00:13:52,300 --> 00:13:54,300
We're skiing to Heaven!

150
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:56,900
-Skiing to Heaven?
-That's right!

151
00:13:57,300 --> 00:14:00,300
Why do you want to go to Heaven?

152
00:14:00,300 --> 00:14:02,300
We're going to see the Jade Emperor!

153
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:05,300
You think you're fit to?

154
00:14:05,300 --> 00:14:10,300
You won't even go past the Southern Gate.
The guards will kick you away

155
00:14:11,300 --> 00:14:14,300
-What should we do?
-How will we right a wrong then?

156
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:16,300
Right what wrong?

157
00:14:16,300 --> 00:14:20,900
We've recently discovered
a big scandal!

158
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:23,900
We mustn't breathe a word about it!

159
00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:26,300
It's a big scandal!
We mustn't tell anyone!

160
00:14:27,300 --> 00:14:30,100
What is it?
Tell me about it!

161
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:32,900
Ma-gu has fallen for Mei Shouquan!

162
00:14:32,900 --> 00:14:34,900
They even kissed each other!

163
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:37,900
It's appalling, isn't it?

164
00:14:38,100 --> 00:14:40,100
What else is there?

165
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:42,100
No more...

166
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:51,100
She really fell for a mortal?
That's against the rules

167
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:53,100
Looks like she's giving up
her immortality

168
00:14:53,300 --> 00:14:57,300
I must report this
to the Jade Emperor

169
00:14:58,300 --> 00:15:02,900
Do you need us to go with you to
the Celestial Court to vouch for you?

170
00:15:03,300 --> 00:15:05,900
We never tell tales

171
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:11,300
Do you think the Jade Emperor
would believe you and not me?

172
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:13,300
No...

173
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:19,300
Let me warn you. Nobody else is to know
about this except the three of us!

174
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,300
Why?

175
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:23,300
Otherwise, you'll be doomed

176
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:28,900
If you let news get around,
you'll be offending all the immortals

177
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:32,900
Every immortal takes it upon himself
to guard the reputation of immortals

178
00:15:32,900 --> 00:15:37,300
If they find out you were the ones
who spread the news, you'll be sorry!

179
00:15:38,900 --> 00:15:41,300
Will all of them gang up on us?

180
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:42,900
Of course!

181
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:49,300
We don't tell tales.
Thanks for warning us

182
00:15:49,300 --> 00:15:55,300
But you should continue to
feed me with whatever info you have

183
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:56,900
We will

184
00:15:57,300 --> 00:15:59,300
If we find out anything,
we'll inform you

185
00:15:59,300 --> 00:16:01,300
We won't tell tales

186
00:16:01,300 --> 00:16:06,300
-No telling tales
-Of course not

187
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:09,900
-Don't breathe a word to anyone
-We won't...

188
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:14,300
Goodbye

189
00:16:21,300 --> 00:16:25,900
Nobody tells us what to do!

190
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:30,300
Trying to get us to be the bad guy?
We'll do likewise!

191
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:35,300
Zhang Guolao, you stupid fool! You'll
help the God of Plague fulfil his wish!

192
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:40,300
If we don't tell tales, who would?

193
00:16:41,300 --> 00:16:45,900
Don't fight with me over the chores,
Fuqi-ge. I can manage

194
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:51,300
No. You're a woman. Such a heavy
chore should be the job of a man

195
00:16:51,300 --> 00:16:55,100
It's too tough for you.
You're all of a sweat

196
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:56,100
Thanks

197
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:00,300
It's Shou and Lu

198
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:02,300
What are you doing here?

199
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:05,300
We need to talk

200
00:17:05,300 --> 00:17:08,300
It must be something important.
I'll go first

201
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:12,900
See you!

202
00:17:13,900 --> 00:17:14,900
Shuangxi!

203
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:17,900
That's enough

204
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:20,300
What do you want to see me about?

205
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:25,900
Don't ask me, ask Shou. He said he'd
only say it in both our presence

206
00:17:26,300 --> 00:17:31,300
Quiet down and listen to me.
I had a dream last night

207
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:36,900
I dreamt that Zhang Guolao
called on me. Guess what he told me

208
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:42,300
He said I'm the Longevity Star

209
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:47,900
Fu is the Fortune Star,
and Lu, the Prosperity Star

210
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:53,300
Together, we're the three
Lucky Stars of Heaven

211
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:57,300
What's so funny?

212
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:02,300
Let's go look for
the Deity of Marriage then

213
00:18:02,300 --> 00:18:05,300
I'll ask him
when I can marry Shuangxi

214
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:06,300
Go to hell!

215
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:12,300
And I'll ask him why the Princess
fancies Ouyang Xiaotian instead

216
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:14,900
There's no logic at all

217
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:16,900
Will you be serious?

218
00:18:20,300 --> 00:18:26,300
You seem in a daze, Shou.
Have you been possessed?

219
00:18:28,300 --> 00:18:33,300
Hands off! Hear me out and you'll know
this is too much of a coincidence

220
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:38,300
We were born at the same time
in the same place by the same midwife

221
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:42,300
That goes to prove we were demoted
to become mortals at the same time

222
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:46,300
We're close as brothers,

223
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:51,300
there are Fu (fortune), Lu (prosperity)
and Shou (longevity) in our names,

224
00:18:51,300 --> 00:18:55,300
and at birth, we all were wrapped in
fabrics with Fu, Lu, Shou on it each

225
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:58,300
Doesn't that mean we're
the Three Lucky Stars?

226
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:03,300
Coincidences are common.
You can't just jump to conclusions

227
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:09,300
Precisely. I'm down on my luck.
Wherever I go, people despise me

228
00:19:09,300 --> 00:19:13,100
Do I have the bearing
of an immortal at all?

229
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:19,300
Do I look like someone
who has all the luck in officialdom?

230
00:19:21,300 --> 00:19:25,900
Zhang Guolao also said all three of us
have a line across our palms

231
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:30,100
Mine does.
Show me your palms

232
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:35,900
Fu's does.
So does yours

233
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:40,900
He also said the lines
could be joined to form one line

234
00:19:41,300 --> 00:19:43,300
It's true!

235
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:49,300
There are many people with
a line across their palms

236
00:19:49,300 --> 00:19:52,900
If all the lines could be joined
to form a line,

237
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:54,900
there would be immortals everywhere

238
00:19:55,300 --> 00:20:00,300
Just because of this line, you expect us
to believe we're immortals? Ridiculous!

239
00:20:00,300 --> 00:20:02,900
I have no time for such nonsense

240
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:08,900
Zhang Guolao also said if we don't
become immortals before we turn 30,

241
00:20:08,900 --> 00:20:11,900
we can never return
to the Celestial Court

242
00:20:14,100 --> 00:20:19,300
I just want to start a family.
The Celestial Court? Forget it

243
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:29,300
I only care about the Imperial Court,
not the Celestial Court

244
00:20:31,300 --> 00:20:32,300
You're crazy!

245
00:20:32,300 --> 00:20:34,300
Why won't you believe me?

246
00:20:36,300 --> 00:20:39,300
I must go to the Longevity Village
to find out the truth

247
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:43,300
Ruyi?

248
00:20:46,300 --> 00:20:48,900
You heard our conversation?

249
00:20:50,300 --> 00:20:52,300
You really dreamt of Zhang Guolao?

250
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:56,300
Yes, I did.
But I know you'll never believe me

251
00:20:56,300 --> 00:20:58,300
I believe you

252
00:20:58,300 --> 00:21:00,300
You really do?

253
00:21:01,300 --> 00:21:03,900
I find my dream so mysterious

254
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:09,300
I'd like to make a trip to the
Longevity Village to find out the truth

255
00:21:09,300 --> 00:21:13,900
Go ahead. You'll find out about it
sooner or later anyway

256
00:21:14,300 --> 00:21:17,300
Why are you talking so strangely?

257
00:21:17,300 --> 00:21:19,900
Are you still angry
because of the poem?

258
00:21:57,300 --> 00:22:00,300
No wonder I keep feeling disturbed.
So you're the reason

259
00:22:02,300 --> 00:22:05,900
Not me. You have something
on your mind, that's why

260
00:22:05,900 --> 00:22:07,300
Oh, come on!

261
00:22:07,900 --> 00:22:12,300
By the way, why did you appear
in Shou's dream? You've baffled him

262
00:22:12,300 --> 00:22:14,300
Just what are you up to?

263
00:22:16,300 --> 00:22:18,300
You have the cheek to question me

264
00:22:18,300 --> 00:22:22,900
Had you not done... that with him,
would I have done what I did?

265
00:22:23,300 --> 00:22:27,300
-What is "that"?
-"That" means "that"

266
00:22:28,300 --> 00:22:31,300
What is it?!
I'm busy, you know!

267
00:22:32,300 --> 00:22:35,900
It's... that...
You and he...

268
00:22:40,900 --> 00:22:44,300
The two of you...
Oh, it's disgusting!

269
00:22:44,300 --> 00:22:46,900
Oh, you mean kissing

270
00:22:46,900 --> 00:22:48,900
How easily you said it!

271
00:22:49,300 --> 00:22:54,900
Tell me.
Did you and Mei Shouquan...

272
00:22:55,300 --> 00:22:59,300
Nothing of the sort.
The two of us did not...

273
00:23:00,300 --> 00:23:03,900
I was only trying to lift
the Obedience Spell

274
00:23:05,300 --> 00:23:09,300
Save your effort.
You can never do it

275
00:23:09,300 --> 00:23:12,300
You can ask the Deity of Medicine.
He started it all

276
00:23:13,300 --> 00:23:16,300
Can you come down?
It's tiring talking to you like this

277
00:23:17,300 --> 00:23:19,300
Even if it's to lift the spell,

278
00:23:19,300 --> 00:23:26,100
can you be sure after doing... that with
Mei Shouquan, you won't fall for him?

279
00:23:28,300 --> 00:23:31,900
I knew it! You've acquired
mortal desires! Come down!

280
00:23:33,300 --> 00:23:37,300
I can tell from the expression in
your eyes you're troubled by love!

281
00:23:37,300 --> 00:23:40,900
This is getting rather serious.
Come down!

282
00:23:43,300 --> 00:23:45,300
Get down, Ma Ruyi!

283
00:23:48,300 --> 00:23:50,300
Things are getting out of hand

284
00:23:50,900 --> 00:23:54,900
Initially, I was the only one who
discovered something wasn't quite right

285
00:23:55,300 --> 00:24:01,300
Now even Shishi and Feifei have learnt
about it! They came to me to tell tales!

286
00:24:01,300 --> 00:24:04,300
-How did they find out?
-I don't know

287
00:24:04,300 --> 00:24:08,300
Gossip is a fearful thing.
And they're such talebearers

288
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:13,900
I may have told them not to
breathe a word to anyone,

289
00:24:14,300 --> 00:24:19,300
but if the Jade Emperor finds out
you've fallen in love,

290
00:24:19,300 --> 00:24:21,300
the consequences will be terrible!

291
00:24:21,300 --> 00:24:24,300
What am I going to do?

292
00:24:24,300 --> 00:24:30,300
You mustn't have any more feelings
for Mei Shouquan or see him again!

293
00:24:30,300 --> 00:24:32,300
Don't carry on your mistakes

294
00:24:52,300 --> 00:24:56,300
You mustn't have any more feelings
for Mei Shouquan or see him again!

295
00:24:56,300 --> 00:25:01,300
Don't carry on your mistakes. You must
never... do that with him again!

296
00:25:01,300 --> 00:25:04,300
If I don't kiss him,
how will I break the Obedience Spell?

297
00:25:07,300 --> 00:25:10,900
Will you stop mentioning that word?!

298
00:25:11,900 --> 00:25:14,900
Not lifting the spell is no big deal

299
00:25:14,900 --> 00:25:18,900
If you don't check yourself, the Jade
Emperor will come to know about it

300
00:25:18,900 --> 00:25:22,900
Not only will you get into trouble,
the Trio won't be able to return either

301
00:25:24,300 --> 00:25:29,300
Things are getting out of hand, that
was why I entered Mei Shouquan's dream

302
00:25:37,300 --> 00:25:42,900
Your purpose in coming down is to
help the Trio attain immortality

303
00:25:43,300 --> 00:25:47,300
Yet you ended up falling in love
with one of them

304
00:25:47,300 --> 00:25:53,300
Instead of turning them into immortals,
they've turned you into a mortal!

305
00:25:53,300 --> 00:25:55,300
Stop teasing me

306
00:25:55,300 --> 00:25:59,300
I'm not. I'm just afraid you might
go astray and ruin the Trio and yourself

307
00:26:00,300 --> 00:26:03,300
You'll never understand what love is

308
00:26:04,300 --> 00:26:08,900
Again?
I don't understand what love is?

309
00:26:10,300 --> 00:26:14,300
Now don't you evoke
memories of my painful past...

310
00:26:17,300 --> 00:26:21,900
I don't know what love is?
Back in those days...

311
00:26:22,300 --> 00:26:26,300
Before I became an immortal, I did
this and that... I won't go on anymore!

312
00:26:27,300 --> 00:26:29,300
You haven't finished!

313
00:26:30,300 --> 00:26:32,300
He was heartbroken

314
00:26:35,300 --> 00:26:38,300
I'll follow your instructions

315
00:26:38,300 --> 00:26:42,900
But no matter what happens,
make sure you watch over me

316
00:26:43,300 --> 00:26:48,300
Don't let that fellow give me any more
strokes or I'll come after you

317
00:26:48,300 --> 00:26:53,900
Relax. Just beat the drum
and enjoy the "show"

318
00:26:54,300 --> 00:26:56,300
I simply love to see your "shows"!

319
00:27:04,900 --> 00:27:07,900
Justice, Your Excellency!

320
00:27:09,300 --> 00:27:13,300
What did you beat the drum for?!
I couldn't even sleep in!

321
00:27:13,300 --> 00:27:16,100
I have a complaint to lodge

322
00:27:17,300 --> 00:27:22,900
That's novel. In the past,
you were always the accused

323
00:27:23,300 --> 00:27:28,100
What's the world coming to?
Who are you complaining about?

324
00:27:28,300 --> 00:27:31,300
Here they are, Your Excellency

325
00:27:33,300 --> 00:27:35,300
What is it?
Bring them forward

326
00:27:38,300 --> 00:27:44,900
Firewood, rice, oil and salt?
Are you itching for a beating?

327
00:27:45,300 --> 00:27:50,300
They're indeed what I want to
complain about, Your Excellency

328
00:27:50,300 --> 00:27:54,100
They're non-living things.
What's there to complain?

329
00:27:54,300 --> 00:27:57,900
Is there a rule that says we can't
complain about non-living things?

330
00:27:57,900 --> 00:28:01,300
I insist on complaining about
firewood, rice, oil and salt!

331
00:28:02,300 --> 00:28:06,300
Have you nothing better to do? What
do you have against these four items?

332
00:28:07,300 --> 00:28:12,100
If you can't give me a valid reason,
I'll give you 50 strokes!

333
00:28:12,300 --> 00:28:17,300
Prices of many things, especially
these four items, have been soaring

334
00:28:17,300 --> 00:28:19,300
Few households can afford them

335
00:28:19,300 --> 00:28:24,100
If not for these four items,
I'd have married Shuangxi already

336
00:28:24,100 --> 00:28:26,300
That's a dig at me!

337
00:28:27,300 --> 00:28:29,900
Are you trying to make trouble?

338
00:28:30,300 --> 00:28:34,300
I must teach you a lesson
or there'll be no justice!

339
00:28:34,300 --> 00:28:37,300
Give him 50 strokes!

340
00:28:37,300 --> 00:28:40,300
Hold it...!

341
00:28:40,300 --> 00:28:44,100
I'm lodging a complaint.
What wrong have I done?

342
00:28:44,300 --> 00:28:48,300
You're trying to make trouble.
I have every reason to punish you!

343
00:28:48,300 --> 00:28:50,900
-Give it to him!
-Hold it!

344
00:28:51,300 --> 00:28:55,300
-Who's that?
-It's me, Magistrate Shi

345
00:28:56,300 --> 00:28:57,300
Lord Wei...

346
00:28:59,300 --> 00:29:02,300
Please pardon my tardiness
in welcoming you

347
00:29:04,300 --> 00:29:07,100
Bring a chair and serve tea

348
00:29:08,300 --> 00:29:09,300
Thank you

349
00:29:16,300 --> 00:29:19,300
What can I do for you, Lord Wei?

350
00:29:20,300 --> 00:29:23,900
I was free,
so I thought I'd pay you a visit

351
00:29:25,300 --> 00:29:28,900
You're in the midst of a trial.
Am I disturbing you?

352
00:29:28,900 --> 00:29:30,300
No...

353
00:29:30,300 --> 00:29:33,300
-Please carry on then
-Certainly...

354
00:29:34,300 --> 00:29:36,300
-Give it to him!
-Hold it!

355
00:29:37,300 --> 00:29:42,300
Sorry, Magistrate Shi.
Pardon my ignorance

356
00:29:42,300 --> 00:29:47,300
I've never heard of any law or rule
that allows...

357
00:29:47,300 --> 00:29:52,100
the magistrate to punish a plaintiff
before a hearing

358
00:29:53,300 --> 00:29:58,300
Lord Wei, I must punish him
for making trouble in court

359
00:29:58,300 --> 00:30:00,300
-Give it to him!
-Hold it!

360
00:30:01,300 --> 00:30:04,900
You should still hear the case first

361
00:30:05,300 --> 00:30:09,300
I remember in the past
before I held any position,

362
00:30:09,300 --> 00:30:12,300
you went by the book

363
00:30:12,300 --> 00:30:16,900
Why aren't you doing that now?

364
00:30:21,300 --> 00:30:23,300
Why have you gone quiet?

365
00:30:25,300 --> 00:30:29,300
How do you think I should
handle this case, Lord Wei?

366
00:30:29,300 --> 00:30:32,300
I've never in my life interrogated
firewood, rice, oil and salt before

367
00:30:35,300 --> 00:30:38,300
I must say they're innocent

368
00:30:39,300 --> 00:30:44,900
Indeed they haven't done anything bad

369
00:30:45,100 --> 00:30:51,300
But the four businessmen who are
in control of them are guilty

370
00:30:51,300 --> 00:30:55,300
They monopolize the prices.
The people are suffering as a result

371
00:30:56,300 --> 00:31:01,900
So I suggest you have
the four businessmen arrested

372
00:31:02,300 --> 00:31:04,300
Well said!

373
00:31:05,100 --> 00:31:09,100
I know you're unwilling to do that

374
00:31:11,300 --> 00:31:15,300
They're your nephew, uncles
and cousin, that's why

375
00:31:16,100 --> 00:31:19,100
You cover up for your kin
and grease your own palm

376
00:31:19,100 --> 00:31:24,300
As the magistrate, your duty is to
give the people a peaceful life!

377
00:31:24,300 --> 00:31:30,300
But since you assumed office, the peole
have not been able to live in peace!

378
00:31:30,300 --> 00:31:36,300
If I report you to His Majesty,
what do you think will happen?!

379
00:31:43,300 --> 00:31:49,900
These people are your subordinates

380
00:31:49,900 --> 00:31:52,900
They're all victims of your tyranny!

381
00:31:53,300 --> 00:31:59,900
Mercy, Lord Wei...!
Please don't report me to His Majesty

382
00:32:00,300 --> 00:32:02,900
I beg you!

383
00:32:03,300 --> 00:32:09,300
So what do you think should be done?

384
00:32:09,300 --> 00:32:14,100
Please grant me permission
to go to jail to search my soul

385
00:32:17,300 --> 00:32:22,900
Now you suggested that yourself.
Everybody heard you

386
00:32:23,300 --> 00:32:29,300
Men, see Magistrate Shi to the prison
so he can search his soul!

387
00:33:01,300 --> 00:33:03,900
Hurry, Feifei!
He's here!

388
00:33:12,300 --> 00:33:16,900
Come in to have a seat, sir...

389
00:33:17,300 --> 00:33:19,300
Give me back my bundle

390
00:33:21,300 --> 00:33:25,100
We're the lady bosses here, sir.
I'm Shishi

391
00:33:25,100 --> 00:33:27,100
And I'm Feifei

392
00:33:27,300 --> 00:33:30,900
What are you doing here in this
cold weather? Oh, you're freezing

393
00:33:31,900 --> 00:33:33,900
Come in to warm yourself up!

394
00:33:34,300 --> 00:33:35,900
Where to?

395
00:33:35,900 --> 00:33:39,300
This way...

396
00:33:39,300 --> 00:33:45,100
Let go! I'm on my way to the Longevity
Village. I have no time to lose!

397
00:33:45,300 --> 00:33:46,300
Sir!

398
00:33:48,300 --> 00:33:49,300
You again

399
00:33:49,300 --> 00:33:51,300
Have some wine to warm yourself up

400
00:33:51,300 --> 00:33:53,900
I've kicked the habit.
Make way

401
00:33:54,300 --> 00:33:56,300
-Sir...
-What is it now?

402
00:33:56,300 --> 00:33:59,300
This dish of braised meat
smells great...

403
00:33:59,300 --> 00:34:03,300
I don't take meat. I'm a vegetarian,
and I have buns with me

404
00:34:04,300 --> 00:34:06,300
He doesn't take the bait

405
00:34:07,300 --> 00:34:09,300
Let's scare him to death then

406
00:34:38,300 --> 00:34:40,100
Lightning!

407
00:34:49,300 --> 00:34:50,900
Careful!

408
00:35:04,300 --> 00:35:06,900
-Are you all right, old sir?
-Yes

409
00:35:08,300 --> 00:35:12,300
You're such a kind man.
Heaven will be kind to you too!

410
00:35:13,300 --> 00:35:14,300
We'll see

411
00:35:15,300 --> 00:35:19,300
-We failed again! It's all your fault!
-Why did you pinch me?!

412
00:35:38,300 --> 00:35:41,100
Greetings, Your Highness.
I'm the wife of Imperial Physician Luo

413
00:35:41,100 --> 00:35:43,100
Oh, you're Mrs Luo

414
00:35:44,300 --> 00:35:50,300
Your Highness, my husband died an unjust
death. Please see that justice is done

415
00:35:50,300 --> 00:35:52,300
Please get up and talk

416
00:35:53,300 --> 00:35:56,300
Please rise.
Don't cry in Her Highness' presence

417
00:35:56,300 --> 00:35:58,900
Please get up

418
00:35:59,300 --> 00:36:03,300
Why did Physician Luo kill himself?
And what injustice did he suffer?

419
00:36:03,300 --> 00:36:05,300
His Majesty may have recovered,

420
00:36:05,300 --> 00:36:09,100
but there was an investigation
on the medicines he had taken

421
00:36:09,300 --> 00:36:13,300
I told my husband that was fine
since he had nothing to hide

422
00:36:14,300 --> 00:36:19,100
But he just told me to keep quiet

423
00:36:19,300 --> 00:36:22,900
Then he went off
to look for the Marquis

424
00:36:24,300 --> 00:36:27,300
Did he leave any last words?

425
00:36:27,300 --> 00:36:31,300
He asked me to bring up our child,

426
00:36:32,300 --> 00:36:36,300
and that if I had any problem,
I was to go to the Marquis

427
00:36:37,300 --> 00:36:40,300
Are you sure he asked you
to go to the Marquis?

428
00:36:40,300 --> 00:36:44,300
He said he had arranged everything
with the Marquis

429
00:36:45,300 --> 00:36:49,100
The Marquis would take care of us

430
00:36:54,300 --> 00:36:56,300
Are you all right, Your Highness?

431
00:36:57,300 --> 00:36:59,300
My mind is in a whirl

432
00:36:59,300 --> 00:37:01,300
I have a feeling...

433
00:37:01,300 --> 00:37:05,900
Physician Luo's death had everything
to do with the Marquis

434
00:37:06,300 --> 00:37:09,300
There must be some secret
between them

435
00:37:11,300 --> 00:37:16,100
Did Physician Luo commit suicide
to hide something?

436
00:37:18,300 --> 00:37:21,300
This is a grave matter.
I dare not make any conjecture

437
00:37:22,300 --> 00:37:27,300
Too bad Physician Luo is dead.
I can't investigate the case

438
00:37:27,300 --> 00:37:29,300
What should I do?

439
00:37:32,300 --> 00:37:36,300
That was what happened.
I'd like to hear your views

440
00:37:39,300 --> 00:37:42,300
-Do you want me to tell the truth?
-Tell me quick

441
00:37:47,100 --> 00:37:51,100
Even if Ouyang Xiaotian didn't
mastermind the poisoning,

442
00:37:51,100 --> 00:37:53,100
he was involved in the plot

443
00:37:53,300 --> 00:37:56,900
He and I grew up together.
I know him inside out

444
00:37:57,300 --> 00:38:02,300
I don't believe he'd plot anything
or even harm my father

445
00:38:02,900 --> 00:38:04,900
A fair face may hide a foul heart

446
00:38:04,900 --> 00:38:08,900
The smarter a person is,
the harder it is to read his mind

447
00:38:09,300 --> 00:38:12,300
I'm not shooting my mouth off,
Your Highness

448
00:38:14,300 --> 00:38:19,300
You said when Physician Luo died,
Ouyang Xiaotian was the only one around

449
00:38:19,900 --> 00:38:24,900
That means only he knows the real reason
why Physician Luo killed himself

450
00:38:25,300 --> 00:38:29,300
But when Luo breathed his last,
he admitted to having poisoned Father

451
00:38:31,300 --> 00:38:35,300
May I ask who told you that,
Your Highness?

452
00:38:36,300 --> 00:38:38,900
You suspect Xiaotian
fabricated everything?

453
00:38:39,300 --> 00:38:44,300
To dump all the responsibility onto
Physician Luo, he'd have had to do that

454
00:38:44,300 --> 00:38:46,300
That's just your conjecture

455
00:38:48,300 --> 00:38:52,300
Let me ask you again.
Given the relations between the two,

456
00:38:52,300 --> 00:38:57,300
why should he promise to take care of
Physician Luo's family after his death?

457
00:38:58,300 --> 00:39:00,300
He did it out of compassion, I guess

458
00:39:00,300 --> 00:39:03,300
Compassion for someone who attempted
to kill His Majesty?

459
00:39:05,300 --> 00:39:07,300
That's too far-fetched

460
00:39:09,300 --> 00:39:10,300
Maybe...

461
00:39:12,300 --> 00:39:16,300
Maybe he blackmailed Physician Luo

462
00:39:16,300 --> 00:39:22,300
Or maybe he made Physician Luo yield
by force, or maybe he did both

463
00:39:23,300 --> 00:39:27,900
In any case, it was Ouyang Xiaotian
who caused Physician Luo to kill himself

464
00:39:29,300 --> 00:39:32,900
Xiaotian would never do
a thing like that

465
00:39:33,300 --> 00:39:37,900
Father thinks highly of him, and is
even making him the Prince Consort

466
00:39:39,300 --> 00:39:42,300
You're His Majesty's only child

467
00:39:42,300 --> 00:39:47,300
Should anything happen to His Majesty,
Prince Consort would naturally take over

468
00:39:47,300 --> 00:39:53,300
Without having to stage a single
rebellion, the kingdom will become his

469
00:39:54,300 --> 00:39:56,900
You mean he wants the throne
for himself?

470
00:40:07,300 --> 00:40:09,300
Where am I?

471
00:40:18,900 --> 00:40:21,900
Excuse me,
is this the Longevity Village?

472
00:40:50,300 --> 00:40:55,300
Why are you following me? I'm looking
for the Longevity Village. I mean no harm

473
00:40:55,300 --> 00:41:00,300
Don't say I didn't warn you. I'm not
tasty at all. I'm much too skinny

474
00:41:00,300 --> 00:41:02,300
Stop following me.
I'm off

475
00:41:06,300 --> 00:41:09,300
Longevity Star!

476
00:41:11,300 --> 00:41:14,300
Stop following me!
I told you I don't taste good!

477
00:41:16,300 --> 00:41:19,100
It's you!

478
00:41:19,100 --> 00:41:22,300
No, it's not me. I don't taste good.
I'm far too skinny

479
00:41:22,300 --> 00:41:25,300
You're the benefactor of
the Longevity Village!

480
00:41:26,300 --> 00:41:28,900
You're our benefactor!

481
00:41:29,300 --> 00:41:34,900
I have something to show you.
Come with me, quick!

482
00:41:37,300 --> 00:41:39,300
Get up, all of you!

483
00:41:43,300 --> 00:41:45,300
This is the Longevity Star!

484
00:41:48,300 --> 00:41:51,900
Longevity Star, allow me,
Wang Xiaoniu, to kowtow to you!

485
00:41:54,300 --> 00:41:59,900
Please get up. Did you call me...
Longevity Star just now?

486
00:42:00,300 --> 00:42:04,300
Yes, I did.
Anything wrong with that?

487
00:42:05,100 --> 00:42:07,100
Why did you call me Longevity Star?

488
00:42:07,300 --> 00:42:12,300
See for yourself. You're the spitting
image of the Longevity Star

489
00:42:12,300 --> 00:42:15,300
Who else can you be
but the Longevity Star?

490
00:42:15,300 --> 00:42:21,900
I'm content, having met the Three
Lucky Stars twice in my life

491
00:42:22,300 --> 00:42:27,900
I've met the Fortune Star and
the Prosperity Star, and now, you

492
00:42:28,300 --> 00:42:30,300
I have no more regrets in life!

493
00:42:30,300 --> 00:42:35,300
Come to my house for a meal!
I remember you love to drink

494
00:42:36,300 --> 00:42:39,300
We met before?
How come I don't remember at all?

495
00:42:39,300 --> 00:42:44,900
Of course we met before.
It was over a century ago

496
00:42:45,300 --> 00:42:47,900
I was only eight then

497
00:42:48,300 --> 00:42:52,900
My family was so poor
we had to sell our monkey

498
00:42:53,300 --> 00:42:57,100
I refused and ran off with the monkey

499
00:42:57,300 --> 00:43:01,900
You posed as snowmen and played
with me. Don't you remember?

500
00:43:03,300 --> 00:43:07,900
To show our gratitude for your
great kindness, we built this temple

501
00:43:07,900 --> 00:43:13,900
You shower us with love and
never fail to grant us our wishes

502
00:43:14,300 --> 00:43:19,900
Everyone in our village enjoys good
fortune and longevity. We're so pleased!

503
00:43:20,300 --> 00:43:23,300
If not for your blessing,

504
00:43:23,300 --> 00:43:27,900
we wouldn't be able to
live to such a ripe old age!

505
00:43:32,300 --> 00:43:38,900
I'm sure you remember this pendant.
It was a gift from you

506
00:43:57,300 --> 00:44:01,900
I'm the Longevity Star
who's closely related to you

507
00:44:02,300 --> 00:44:06,300
How long one's lifespan is
is all decided by me

508
00:44:06,300 --> 00:44:11,300
I used to be the Deity of the South

509
00:44:11,300 --> 00:44:15,300
Then the Jade Emperor put me
in charge of the lifespan of mortals

510
00:44:15,300 --> 00:44:18,900
That's why I'm known as
the Longevity Star!

511
00:44:19,300 --> 00:44:22,300
May you enjoy good fortune,
prosperity and longevity...

512
00:44:22,300 --> 00:44:25,300
like the characters
on the pendant say

513
00:44:32,300 --> 00:44:34,300
I remember this pendant

514
00:44:38,300 --> 00:44:40,300
Don't tell me I really am
the Longevity Star?

515
00:44:40,300 --> 00:44:42,300
Subtitled by S Lin


